      "text": "PostgreSQL 15 (primary):\n  users, recipes, ingredients,\n  user_favorites, user_ratings,\n  sessions, error_logs,\n  metrics_events\n  GIN full-text RU, JSONB nutrition\n\nRedis 7 (cache):\n  popular_recipes (TTL 30m)\n  search:{hash} (TTL 5m)\n  refresh_blacklist\n\nYandex Object Storage (S3):\n  cookie-recipes-images/\n   ├ thumb/  (200x200 WebP)\n   ├ medium/ (600x400)\n   └ large/  (1200x800)\n  cookie-avatars/",
